frames: -- hello: capability bit 14 FRAMES
frames: caps bit 14 1
frames: caps bit 22 1
frames: -- lamp parts (D7 10, #561): the left's chain, then the right's
frames: parts status 0, 2 parts: 21 21
frames: -- a chunk without SHOW: no reply, nothing drawn, the lights stay with the keyboard
frames: replies so far 0
frames: -- a whole frame (5 reports): lamp 3 red on the left, lamp 30 green on the right
frames: left taken from its effect
frames: left draws 3=FF0000
frames: right taken from its effect
frames: right link sends 21 lamps from 21
frames: right draws 30=00FF00
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: -- one lamp changes on the right: only it goes over the link
frames: left draws 3=FF0000
frames: right link sends 1 lamps from 30
frames: right draws 30=0000FF
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: -- the same frame again: nothing goes over the link
frames: left draws 3=FF0000
frames: right link sends nothing (no change)
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: -- one colour per half (the scene fallback): left orange, right blue, as a fill
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
frames: right link sends a fill of 21 lamps from 21: 0000FF
frames: right draws 21-41=0000FF
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: -- a burst of 5 frames: the left draws each, the right the first and the newest only
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
frames: right link sends 1 lamps from 21
frames: right draws 21=001000 22-41=0000FF
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left draws 0-20=FF8000
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: right link sends 1 lamps from 21
frames: right draws 21=005000 22-41=0000FF
frames: -- bad requests: 10 lamps, lamps past 41, a report cut short
hostlink: rx D7 8C 05 03 03 01
hostlink: rx D7 8C 05 03 03 01
hostlink: rx D7 8C 05 03 03 01
frames: -- RELEASE: both halves back to their effect
frames: left back to its effect
frames: right back to its effect
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 00 03 01
frames: -- a frame, then silence: the timeout hands back and says so (event 1)
frames: left taken from its effect
frames: left draws 0=FFFFFF
frames: right taken from its effect
frames: right link sends a fill of 21 lamps from 21: 000000
frames: right draws black
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left back to its effect
frames: right back to its effect
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 00 03 01 01
frames: -- a frame, then the endpoint changes: hands back and says so
frames: left taken from its effect
frames: left draws black
frames: right taken from its effect
frames: right link sends 21 lamps from 21
frames: right draws 41=FFFFFF
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 03 03 01
frames: left back to its effect
frames: right back to its effect
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 00 03 01 01
frames: -- RELEASE with nothing taken: ok, owner none, no change
hostlink: rx D7 8C 00 00 03 01
frames: -- done
